@startuml
title Абстракция LLM провайдеров (LLM Provider Abstraction - Phase 15.3)

interface BaseLLMProvider <<Adapter>> {
    +generate(prompt, system_prompt, temperature, max_tokens, history): GenerationResult
    +generate_stream(prompt, ...): Iterator[str]
    +model_name: str  <<property>>
}

class GenerationResult <<Core>> {
    +text: str
    +model: str
    +input_tokens: int
    +output_tokens: int
    +finish_reason: str
    --
    +total_tokens: int
}

class GeminiLLMProvider <<Adapter>> {
    -client: genai.Client
    -model: str
    --
    +generate(...): GenerationResult
    +model_name: str
}

class OpenAILLMProvider <<Adapter>> {
    -client: OpenAI
    -provider: ProviderPreset
    -model: str
    -base_url: str|None
    --
    +generate(...): GenerationResult
    +generate_stream(...): Iterator[str]
    +model_name: str
}

enum ProviderPreset <<Core>> {
    OPENAI
    OLLAMA
    OPENROUTER
    VLLM
    LM_STUDIO
}

note right of OpenAILLMProvider
    **Phase 15.3 Implementation**
    
    Unified provider for:
    • OpenAI (GPT-4o, o1)
    • Ollama (llama3, mistral)
    • OpenRouter (cloud routing)
    • vLLM (self-hosted)
    • LM Studio (local UI)
    
    Uses official OpenAI SDK
    with custom base_url override
end note

BaseLLMProvider <|.. GeminiLLMProvider
BaseLLMProvider <|.. OpenAILLMProvider

OpenAILLMProvider --> ProviderPreset : uses

BaseLLMProvider --> GenerationResult : returns

note right of GeminiLLMProvider
    **Built-in Provider**
    Uses google-genai SDK
    
    Models:
    • gemini-2.0-flash (fast)
    • gemini-2.0-pro (quality)
    • gemini-1.5-flash-8b (cheap)
end note

legend right
    |= Provider |= Implementation |= Status |
    | Gemini | GeminiLLMProvider | ✅ Phase 9 |
    | OpenAI | OpenAILLMProvider | ✅ Phase 15.3 |
    | Ollama | OpenAILLMProvider | ✅ Phase 15.3 |
    | OpenRouter | OpenAILLMProvider | ✅ Phase 15.3 |
    | vLLM | OpenAILLMProvider | ✅ Phase 15.3 |
    | LM Studio | OpenAILLMProvider | ✅ Phase 15.3 |
    | Anthropic | AnthropicProvider | ❌ Not implemented |
    | <<Adapter>> | External adapters | |
    | <<Core>> | Business logic | |
endlegend
@enduml
